<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0119_D37R0104_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hold up!\rWhat I told you before was a lie.\nI thought I could tail you, and\fyou’d lead me to Lance.\rWell, he never showed.\f...Don’t matter.\rI was gon’ beat you after Lance,\nbut since you here, I’ma settle\fthe score!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0119_D37R0104_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...I don’t get it.\rWas that Lance dude right?\nThat I don’t treat my homies right?\rLove...\rTrust...\rThat’s what I’m missin’?\nThat’s why I keep losin’?\rI... I just don’t get it. But\nit ain’t endin’ here. Not now.\fNot ’cause of this.\rI ain’t givin’ up on bein’\nthe best Hustler in the world!\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
